<title>SINGAPORE: Promet in takeover offer for IPCO.</title>
<headline>Promet in takeover offer for IPCO.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Promet Bhd said on Tuesday it has raised its stake in IPCO International Ltd to 59.2 percent and is making a general offer at US$2.40 per share.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the move followed an agreement by Promet through its subsidiary Oradea Pte Ltd to acquire a 29.6 percent stake in IPCO from Australian-based Leighton Holdings Ltd for US$28.15 million or US$2.40 per share.</p>
</text>
